{
  "schema_version": "stk_online_controller_v2",
  "controller_config": {
    "credit_metric": "absolute_signed_gain_per_cpu",
    "evolve_every": 32,
    "parameter_mode": "bounded_relative",
    "structural_mode": "atomic_template",
    "paired_race": true
  },
  "recipes": [
    {
      "name": "bounded_second_ring",
      "features": [
        {
          "name": "second_ring_fraction",
          "expression": {
            "op": "div",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "count",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "difference",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "neighbors_of_set",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "neighbors",
                            "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "union",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "singleton",
                            "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "neighbors",
                            "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "max",
                "args": [
                  {"op": "const", "value": 1},
                  {
                    "op": "sub",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "count",
                        "args": [{"op": "available", "args": []}]
                      },
                      {"op": "const", "value": 1}
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "rule": "c0 * weight / max(1, 1 + degree) + c1 * weight * second_ring_fraction - c2 * max_conflict_weight - c3 * conflict_weight / max(1, degree)",
      "patch_policy": {
        "anchor": "uniform",
        "destroy_count": 1,
        "patch_cap": 16,
        "expand_hops": 1,
        "reconstruction": "greedy"
      },
      "evaluation_plan": {
        "feature_scope": "patch",
        "max_feature_cpu_fraction": 0.06,
        "lazy": true
      },
      "adaptation_template": {
        "mutation_scales": [0.03, 0.06, 0.06, 0.08],
        "stagnation_trials": 32,
        "action": "mutate"
      },
      "coefficients": [1.0, 0.06, 0.025, 0.02],
      "rationale": "A small uniform repair provides an inexpensive observation channel. The dimensionless second-ring fraction supplies topology beyond first-order neighbor totals and gives a modest bonus to compatible contacts reached through competing neighbors. Every score term has units of seconds. Its direction is a scheduling hypothesis, evaluated through complete signed gains and charged CPU; neither second-ring reach nor certificate agreement proves an improvement."
    },
    {
      "name": "clique_crowding",
      "features": [
        {
          "name": "neighbor_cover_fraction",
          "expression": {
            "op": "div",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "clique_cover_weight",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "neighbors",
                    "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "max",
                "args": [
                  {"op": "const", "value": 0.000001},
                  {
                    "op": "sum_weights",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "neighbors",
                        "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "neighbor_edge_density",
          "expression": {
            "op": "div",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "mul",
                "args": [
                  {"op": "const", "value": 2},
                  {
                    "op": "count",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "induced_edges",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "neighbors",
                            "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "max",
                "args": [
                  {"op": "const", "value": 1},
                  {
                    "op": "mul",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "count",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "neighbors",
                            "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "sub",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "count",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "neighbors",
                                "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {"op": "const", "value": 1}
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "rule": "c0 * weight - c1 * conflict_weight * neighbor_cover_fraction + c2 * weight * neighbor_edge_density - c3 * max_conflict_weight",
      "patch_policy": {
        "anchor": "blocked_gain",
        "destroy_count": 3,
        "patch_cap": 24,
        "expand_hops": 1,
        "reconstruction": "greedy"
      },
      "evaluation_plan": {
        "feature_scope": "patch",
        "max_feature_cpu_fraction": 0.12,
        "lazy": true
      },
      "adaptation_template": {
        "mutation_scales": [0.03, 0.04, 0.06, 0.08],
        "stagnation_trials": 48,
        "action": "mutate"
      },
      "coefficients": [1.0, 0.45, 0.12, 0.025],
      "rationale": "Neighbor cover and exact undirected edge density distinguish mutually conflicting alternatives from alternatives that can coexist. Both features are dimensionless; multiplication by neighbor mass or root weight makes the score consistently seconds. Blocked-gain anchoring tests this composition around sampled incumbent blockers. The cover summarizes an opportunity-cost bound, while density supplies a separate crowding correction; their usefulness must survive actual complete reconstruction and cost accounting."
    },
    {
      "name": "rejection_pack_gap",
      "features": [
        {
          "name": "neighbor_pack_fraction",
          "expression": {
            "op": "div",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "greedy_independent_weight",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "neighbors",
                    "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "max",
                "args": [
                  {"op": "const", "value": 0.000001},
                  {
                    "op": "sum_weights",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "neighbors",
                        "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "neighbor_cover_fraction",
          "expression": {
            "op": "div",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "clique_cover_weight",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "neighbors",
                    "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "max",
                "args": [
                  {"op": "const", "value": 0.000001},
                  {
                    "op": "sum_weights",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "neighbors",
                        "args": [{"op": "root", "args": []}]
                      }
                    ]
